@baseUrl = https://localhost:7146
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/category-interests
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Create an interest category
POST {{apiUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Technology"
}

### Paginated interest categories — no auth required
GET {{apiUrl}}/pagination?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
